# Decks for modes this build does not carry. The files stay on disk so a mode
# can be brought back without re-harvesting anything, they just do not need to
# be served: nothing in the five modes fetches them, and between them they are
# 108MB of the repo. The small dead decks (nations, leagues, mystery, and the
# rest) DO stay in, because build-mc.js reads them to find its wrong answers.
